{
  "_comment": "WEAVE V4 S3_E3: effective batch 256 (128×2), LR 日程与 S1/S2 对齐（num_epochs=25, CosineAnnealingLR 按 epoch 步进），step 上限 2000，内部早停开启。",
  "_base": "../../config.json",
  "model": {
    "target_latent_hf_subband_fusion_enabled": true,
    "target_latent_hf_head_fusion_gate_init": 0.05
